{%- comment -%}
  Furgenics — description-accordion snippet (v2, 2026-08-14)
  Restructures the (token-substituted) PDP description into a visible
  answer-first opener + a native <details>/<summary> accordion, one row per
  <h2> section, in document order — plus two Phase 2 behaviors:

  1. INCI handling. If a section heading contains "ingredients"
     (handleized), the `custom.full_ingredients` list is appended INTO that
     row's body (the v4 "Ingredients & safety" section). Otherwise — v2/v3
     bodies with no ingredients heading — the INCI renders as its own
     standalone row at `ingredients_position`, exactly as v1 of this snippet
     did. Both paths suppress known placeholder values ("TEST").

  2. Comparison extraction. A section whose handleized heading starts with
     "how-it-compares" is pulled OUT of the accordion and rendered after it
     as a visible compact block (class `furgenics-comparison`) — persuasive
     content below reference content, ahead of the bundle block. The <h2>
     stays a real heading and keeps its anchor id, so the heading outline
     and deep links are unchanged.

  SEO rationale (unchanged from v1):
  - All content stays server-rendered in the DOM; nothing is removed.
  - H2s remain real <h2> headings (inside <summary>, valid per HTML spec).
  - The pre-H2 opener stays visible for the answer-first AEO pattern.
  - Rows get stable anchor ids (handleized heading); a tiny script
    auto-opens a row when the URL hash targets it.

  Usage (inside sections/main-product.liquid, AFTER token substitution):
    {% render 'description-accordion',
       description_html: rendered_description,
       product: product %}

  Parameters:
    description_html      (string)   Token-substituted description HTML.
    product               (object)   Product object; used for the INCI row.
    show_ingredients      (boolean)  Render INCI (merged or standalone).
                                     Default true.
    ingredients_position  (number)   1-based row position for the STANDALONE
                                     INCI row (only used when no section
                                     heading contains "ingredients").
                                     Default 4.
    open_first            (boolean)  Render the first row expanded. Default true.

  Content conventions (v4 template order — see
  analyses/2026-08-14-pdp-phase2-build.md):
    1. Opener (before first <h2>) — stays visible.
    2. "Best for & expected results" — bullets.
    3. "Dilution & professional protocol" — numbered steps.
    4. "Ingredients & safety" — chemistry + safety copy; INCI auto-appended.
    5. "How it compares on cost" — extracted below the accordion.
    6. "Shipping, samples & the Groomer Program".
    - <h2> headings must be plain text (no nested inline tags).
    - Descriptions with no <h2> (e.g. 8oz samples) render unchanged.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign _html = description_html | default: product.description -%}
{%- assign _show_ingredients = show_ingredients | default: true, allow_false: true -%}
{%- assign _ingredients_position = ingredients_position | default: 4 -%}
{%- assign _open_first = open_first | default: true, allow_false: true -%}

{%- assign _sections = _html | split: '<h2' -%}

{%- if _sections.size <= 1 -%}
  {{ _html }}
{%- else -%}

  {%- liquid
    assign _inci = product.metafields.custom.full_ingredients.value
    if _inci == 'TEST'
      assign _inci = blank
    endif
    comment
      Detect whether any section heading contains "ingredients" — if so the
      INCI merges into that row and the standalone row is suppressed.
    endcomment
    assign _has_ingredients_section = false
    for _section in _sections offset: 1
      assign _h = _section | split: '</h2>' | first | split: '>' | last | strip | handleize
      if _h contains 'ingredients'
        assign _has_ingredients_section = true
      endif
    endfor
  -%}

  {%- capture _ingredients_row -%}
    {%- if _show_ingredients and _inci != blank -%}
      <details class="furgenics-pdp-acc-item" id="pdp-full-ingredients-inci">
        <summary>
          <h2 class="furgenics-pdp-acc-heading">Full ingredients (INCI)</h2>
          <span class="furgenics-pdp-acc-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&#9013;</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="furgenics-pdp-acc-body"><p>{{ _inci }}</p></div>
      </details>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}

  <div class="furgenics-pdp-opener">{{ _sections[0] }}</div>

  {%- assign _deferred_heading = '' -%}
  {%- assign _deferred_body = '' -%}
  {%- assign _deferred_id = '' -%}

  <div class="furgenics-pdp-accordion">
    {%- assign _row = 0 -%}
    {%- for _section in _sections offset: 1 -%}
      {%- assign _head_and_rest = _section | split: '</h2>' -%}
      {%- assign _heading = _head_and_rest[0] | split: '>' | last | strip -%}
      {%- assign _body = _section | remove_first: _head_and_rest[0] | remove_first: '</h2>' -%}
      {%- assign _handle = _heading | handleize -%}

      {%- if _handle contains 'how-it-compares' -%}
        {%- assign _deferred_heading = _heading -%}
        {%- assign _deferred_body = _body -%}
        {%- assign _deferred_id = _handle -%}
        {%- continue -%}
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- assign _row = _row | plus: 1 -%}
      {%- if _has_ingredients_section == false and _row == _ingredients_position -%}{{ _ingredients_row }}{%- endif -%}

      <details class="furgenics-pdp-acc-item" id="pdp-{{ _handle }}"{% if _open_first and _row == 1 %} open{% endif %}>
        <summary>
          <h2 class="furgenics-pdp-acc-heading">{{ _heading }}</h2>
          <span class="furgenics-pdp-acc-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&#9013;</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="furgenics-pdp-acc-body">
          {{ _body }}
          {%- if _handle contains 'ingredients' and _show_ingredients and _inci != blank %}
            <p class="furgenics-pdp-inci"><strong>Full ingredients (INCI):</strong> {{ _inci }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      </details>
    {%- endfor -%}

    {%- if _has_ingredients_section == false -%}
      {%- if _ingredients_position > _row -%}{{ _ingredients_row }}{%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  {%- if _deferred_heading != blank -%}
    <div class="furgenics-comparison" id="pdp-{{ _deferred_id }}">
      <h2 class="furgenics-comparison__heading">{{ _deferred_heading }}</h2>
      <div class="furgenics-comparison__body">{{ _deferred_body }}</div>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  <style>
    .furgenics-pdp-accordion { margin-top: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5; }
    .furgenics-pdp-acc-item { border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5; }
    .furgenics-pdp-acc-item > summary { list-style: none; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; padding: 16px 0; min-height: 52px; box-sizing: border-box; }
    .furgenics-pdp-acc-item > summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
    .furgenics-pdp-acc-item > summary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid currentColor; outline-offset: 2px; }
    .furgenics-pdp-acc-heading { margin: 0; font-size: inherit; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; }
    .furgenics-pdp-acc-arrow { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 20px; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1; }
    .furgenics-pdp-acc-item[open] > summary .furgenics-pdp-acc-arrow { transform: rotate(180deg); }
    .furgenics-pdp-acc-body { padding: 0 0 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555; }
    .furgenics-pdp-inci { font-size: 0.9em; }
    .furgenics-comparison { margin: 24px 0 8px; padding: 16px 18px; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 8px; }
    .furgenics-comparison__heading { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 1.05em; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; }
    .furgenics-comparison__body { font-size: 0.95em; line-height: 1.55; color: #555; }
    .furgenics-comparison__body p { margin: 0 0 10px; }
    .furgenics-comparison__body p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
      .furgenics-pdp-acc-arrow { transition: transform 0.2s ease; }
    }
  </style>

  <script>
    (function () {
      function openTarget() {
        var hash = window.location.hash;
        if (!hash || hash.length < 2) return;
        var el = document.getElementById(hash.slice(1));
        if (el && el.tagName === 'DETAILS') el.open = true;
      }
      openTarget();
      window.addEventListener('hashchange', openTarget);
    })();
  </script>
{%- endif -%}
